OL,4,CTrump leaves China after holding       
OL,5,Chistoric 90-minute talks with Xi and   
OL,6,CPutin                                  
OL,7,GDonald Trump has left China after      
OL,8,Gholding talks for about 90 minutes     
OL,9,Gwith Russian President Vladimir Putin  
OL,10,Gand Xi Jinping in the city of Shenzhen.
OL,12,FFollowing the summit, the US, China    
OL,13,Fand Russia issue a "joint declaration  
OL,14,Fon peace", in which they say "nuclear  
OL,15,Fwar cannot be won and must never be    
OL,16,Ffought".                               
OL,18,FIn footage released by the Kremlin of  
OL,19,Fhim leaving the venue, Putin says to   
OL,20,FXi "I don't think anyone even expected 
OL,21,Feverything to go so well".             
